{"id":"en_the-deal-that-turned-into-love","title":"The Deal That Turned Into Love","titleEn":"The Deal That Turned Into Love","description":"Kaitlin rescues the nephew of Nathan, the wealthiest man in the country, and intends simply to collect her reward and move on. Instead, she ends up in a flash marriage with the tycoon himself. The nephew, full of himself, keeps pestering her, so she promptly puts him in his place and teaches him to respect his new aunt. When her parents show up hoping to profit from her situation, she refuses to let family ties stop her from standing her ground. Amid handling these troublesome people, Kaitlin looks forward to a divorce and a generous settlement. Yet Nathan grows increasingly attached and clingy, behaving like a lovesick man rather than someone heading for a split.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-deal-that-turned-into-love/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-deal-that-turned-into-love/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Dominant","Strong Female Lead","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4396/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-deal-that-turned-into-love_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4396/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-deal-that-turned-into-love_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4396/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-deal-that-turned-into-love_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4396/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"